&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of closing sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in big data, Cloud, or SaaS sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to quickly learn new technologies and value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience exceeding sales KPIs and quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success closing new accounts while working existing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
